  <jpcrp_cor:RevenuesFromExternalCustomersInformationForEachRegionTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;(1）売上高&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;　本邦の外部顧客への売上高が連結損益計算書の90％を超えるため、記載を省略しております。&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:RevenuesFromExternalCustomersInformationForEachRegionTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentInformationForEachRegionTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;(2）有形固定資産&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;　本邦以外に所在している有形固定資産がないため、該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentInformationForEachRegionTextBlock>
